NOTICE

This is **not** an Open Source licence, and it is not the Business Source
Licence. Its structure — a source-available grant that converts to an open
source licence on a stated date — follows the Business Source License 1.1,
but the terms differ in one substantive way and it therefore does not use that
name.

The difference: BUSL 1.1 grants all non-production use free of charge, which
would include academic research. This licence does not. Under this licence,
**educational use is free and research use is not**; see sections 2 and 3.

On the Change Date the version of the Licensed Work then published becomes
available under the Change License, and these restrictions cease to apply to
that version.

